WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
What's going on

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,480
Didn't I play well just now?

3
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,680
Can that be called a beating?

4
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,840
Not unilaterally

5
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,720
Five S series play a game for us to watch

6
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,080
Have some fun

7
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,760
The one who only uses mental power to attack

8
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,720
It’s rare to meet a match in The Big Trouble

9
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,200
The campfire is for frying fish

10
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,560
I don’t know which big guys they are

11
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,240
This is what you can see at LV2 level

12
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:22,500
Both of their teams are actually LV1 doctors

13
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:25,040
You've been cruel, but I haven't.

14
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,400
He wants to attack us with spiritual power

15
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,360
Just started counterattack

16
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,600
His mental strength will be broken.

17
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,930
This time he was completely ruined

18
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:33,930
The team that advanced to LV2 is

19
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:36,890
I really didn't do anything by the light of the campfire.

20
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:38,090
His mental strength suddenly stopped

21
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:39,490
Let's take him to the hospital for a checkup later.

22
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:42,530
Then we have to wait for their team's mecha masters to take it out first if you don't help.

23
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:43,450
Can he do it as a B-level?

24
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:44,530
I'm not their teammate either.

25
00:00:44,530 --> 00:00:45,650
I don’t know much about their mechas either.

26
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:47,570
Aren't you afraid that I will be blown up when you dismantle someone else's mecha?
